<title>USA: Boardwalk Casino names Greathouse CEO.</title>
<headline>Boardwalk Casino names Greathouse CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boardwalk Casino Inc Wednesday named Steve Greathouse to the post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the position has been vacant since the death of the company founder Norbert Jansen in early January of this year.</p>
<p>Greathouse resigned from Alliance Gaming in late 1996.</p>
